{"title":"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 44","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_44&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/a/cbabf1c20c9b53b958ebbb287c12f09ab76f19e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{xy}{x+y}= a,\\frac{xz}{x+z}= b,\\frac{yz}{y+z}= c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"251\" height=\"36\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/c/acc6d9a6172d35127b6cb37ea92192caf7029a54.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a, b, c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"43\" height=\"18\" /> are other than zero, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> equals: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/b/03bf14adbd279412069b799c3dce5f7271e80ddd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\frac{abc}{ab+ac+bc}\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ \\frac{2abc}{ab+bc+ac}\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ \\frac{2abc}{ab+ac-bc}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"465\" height=\"39\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/7/317db5a470a6d2662de9365fd96a1674673a4840.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(D)}\\ \\frac{2abc}{ab+bc-ac}\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ \\frac{2abc}{ac+bc-ab}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"297\" height=\"39\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_44&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/2/2e26cb59e0117de4242b355928b7e37ebbd36af6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{a}=\\frac{1}{x}+\\frac{1}{y}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"86\" height=\"40\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/b/f7b42f1774cb944db55a1c116f5451d77631a7bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{b}=\\frac{1}{x}+\\frac{1}{z}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"85\" height=\"37\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/3/763209096c5b116af1748b72b0429a0cf9b6bbf0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{c}=\\frac{1}{y}+\\frac{1}{z}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"84\" height=\"40\" />. Therefore\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/b/fdbbaf08e15d5d2bbb99a9f9c1034faec16e7827.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{1}{x}+\\frac{1}{y}+\\frac{1}{z}=\\frac{\\frac{1}{a}+\\frac{1}{b}+\\frac{1}{c}}{2}\\]\" width=\"187\" height=\"44\" />\n</p><p>Therefore\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/4/ee475f57576a66bd88886cf2b4f513be655f284f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{1}{x}=\\frac{1}{2a}+\\frac{1}{2b}+\\frac{1}{2c}-\\frac{1}{c}=\\frac{1}{2a}+\\frac{1}{2b}-\\frac{1}{2c}\\]\" width=\"312\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>A little algebraic manipulation yields that\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/e/17e768245dacfd70d570557db02efad7fe03c07b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x=\\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}\\ \\frac{2abc}{ac+bc-ab}}\\]\" width=\"177\" height=\"50\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_44&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95